  "contentHtmlFurigana": "\n                      <div style=\"background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0)!important;border-color:rgb(255,255,255)!important;color:rgb(255,255,255)!important\"><div><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><ruby>皆<rt>みな</rt></ruby>さん、こんばんは</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">15<ruby>歳<rt>さい</rt></ruby> <ruby>渡辺<rt>わたなべ</rt></ruby><ruby>莉奈<rt>りな</rt></ruby>です。</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><ruby>気付<rt>きづ</rt></ruby>けば8<ruby>月<rt>つき</rt></ruby>も<ruby>残<rt>のこ</rt></ruby>りあと<ruby>少<rt>すこ</rt></ruby>しになり、<ruby>秋<rt>あき</rt></ruby>が<ruby>本格<rt>ほんかく</rt></ruby><ruby>的<rt>てき</rt></ruby>に<ruby>始<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>まりそうですね</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">9<ruby>月<rt>つき</rt></ruby>は<ruby>長月<rt>ながつき</rt></ruby>と<ruby>言<rt>い</rt></ruby>う<ruby>名<rt>な</rt></ruby>があるように、<ruby>夜<rt>よる</rt></ruby>の<ruby>時間<rt>じかん</rt></ruby>が<ruby>長<rt>なが</rt></ruby>くなってきますね</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">どちらかと<ruby>言<rt>い</rt></ruby>うと<ruby>夜行<rt>やこう</rt></ruby><ruby>性<rt>せい</rt></ruby>で<ruby>夜<rt>よる</rt></ruby>が<ruby>好<rt>す</rt></ruby>きなので、<ruby>少<rt>すこ</rt></ruby>し<ruby>薄暗<rt>うすぐら</rt></ruby>い<ruby>方<rt>ほう</rt></ruby>が<ruby>落ち着<rt>おちつ</rt></ruby>くんです。この<ruby>時期<rt>じき</rt></ruby>の<ruby>夕暮<rt>ゆうぐ</rt></ruby>れ<ruby>時<rt>じ</rt></ruby>が<ruby>四季<rt>しき</rt></ruby>の<ruby>中<rt>なか</rt></ruby>で<ruby>一番<rt>いちばん</rt></ruby>エモい<ruby>瞬間<rt>しゅんかん</rt></ruby>だな~と<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>います</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">それに<ruby>秋<rt>あき</rt></ruby>って<ruby>案外<rt>あんがい</rt></ruby><ruby>早<rt>はや</rt></ruby>く<ruby>過ぎ去<rt>すぎさ</rt></ruby>っていくので、<ruby>早<rt>はや</rt></ruby>いうちに<ruby>可愛<rt>かわい</rt></ruby>い<ruby>秋<rt>あき</rt></ruby><ruby>服<rt>ふく</rt></ruby>をゲットしないと</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ミーグリも<ruby>始<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>まるからね</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important;background-color:rgba(0,0,0,0);border-color:rgb(0,0,0);color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><ruby>秋<rt>あき</rt></ruby>と<ruby>言<rt>い</rt></ruby>えばお<ruby>芋<rt>いも</rt></ruby>のスイーツが<ruby>期間<rt>きかん</rt></ruby><ruby>限定<rt>げんてい</rt></ruby>で<ruby>登場<rt>とうじょう</rt></ruby>したり、<ruby>月見<rt>つきみ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>季節<rt>きせつ</rt></ruby>がやってきたりと<ruby>幸<rt>しあわ</rt></ruby>せなことばかり^^</span><br style=\"color:rgb(255,255,255);font-family:'-apple-system','helveticaneue';font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\"><span style=\"font-family:-apple-system,helveticaneue;font-size:15px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;tex